{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大埔有人懷疑猝斃。今日（17日）上午11時25分，警方接獲一名53歲姓區女子的家人報案，指懷疑她在運頭塘邨運來樓家中暈倒。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，消防破門而入，惟事主被尋獲時已明顯死亡。警方將案件列「屍體發現」，稍後將安排為事主驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"大埔運頭塘邨運來樓一名53歲女子被揭發倒斃家中。（資料圖片/黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186319747869184000305647.jpeg/dfJ8YPeHwDDbpNrZeT5uQeri7MW8-RQ6CGx8Fy1sfBc\"/><figcaption>大埔運頭塘邨運來樓一名53歲女子被揭發倒斃家中。（資料圖片/黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.229179+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:29:43.084165+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:54.614914+00:00","content_hash":"81d9edebb1316b3526c1d6dc5b193a003b879face4e58bcf460bb88aac2ccea7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}